  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://resources.godsted.com/modrinth/wilderflowers/image.png\" alt=\"野花綻放\" width=\"562\" height=\"237\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-flowers%252fversions%253fl%253dfabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-flowers%252fversions%253fl%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cassiancc/Cassians-Badges/refs/heads/main/cozy/NeoForge.svg\" alt=\"支援 NeoForge\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-flowers%252fversions%253fl%253dforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/raspberry-flavoured\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cassiancc/Cassians-Badges/refs/heads/main/cozy/Raspberry-Flavoured.svg\" alt=\"Raspberry Flavoured\" height=\"56\"></a></p><h2>概述</h2><p>此模組透過加入野花，為原版世界生成增添了一系列全新植物。這些花朵可以製作成花環裝飾品，既能穿戴也能擺放。此外，Wilder Flowers 也在多種生態域中加入了三葉草叢。</p><h2>常見問題</h2><ul>\n<li>此模組會移植到其他版本或載入器嗎？\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fdavigj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DavigJ</a> 積極維護模組的 Forge 版本，而 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fCassian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cassiancc</a> 則負責 Fabric 和 NeoForge 版本。目前沒有計劃移植到任何舊版的 Minecraft，也不打算支援 1.20.1 之後的 Forge 版本；最新版本的移植將在準備就緒時推出。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>授權條款</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/davigj/wilder-flowers/blob/main/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-MIT-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"程式碼授權 (MIT)\"></a></p><p>Wilder Flowers 採用開放原始碼的 MIT 授權條款。請注意，這表示如果您在自己的專案中使用本模組的任何內容，您必須標註本模組。</p><h2>致謝</h2><p>如有任何建議，歡迎前往<a href=\"https://github.com/davidjjung/wilderflowers/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>提出！</p><p>此模組的功能最初是在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fraspberry-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raspberry Core</a> 中作為 Raspberry Flavoured 的原創功能實作。經過多次迭代後，才被獨立出來成為單獨的模組。</p><p>花朵的實作由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkobber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kobber</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fCassian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cassiancc</a> 完成，紋理由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProbablyEkho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProbablyEkho</a> 製作。</p><p>移植到獨立 Forge 1.19.2 模組由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fdavigj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DavigJ</a> 完成，而後續移植到多載入器 1.21.x 則是由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fCassian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cassiancc</a> 負責。</p>",
